cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Indigenous AI: an atlas of NLP initiatives for Indigenous languages"
message: "If you use this atlas or its technique guide, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Mila — Indigenous AI"
# The deployment hostname. It appears in THREE published files — here,
# docs/mkdocs.yml's site_url, and the site link in README.md — and
# atlas/tests/deploy-hostname.test.ts is what keeps them equal. The Vercel
# project does not exist yet, so this is an assumption to be corrected on the
# first real deploy; correct all three in one commit.
url: "https://indigenous-ai-atlas.vercel.app/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
# NO doi: field. The DOI does not exist until a Zenodo release is cut, and a
# placeholder would be exactly the claim-more-than-is-true failure that this
# repository's build gate exists to prevent. Add it here, and to README.md,
# once the release is minted.
